Every key, one place

Launcher
  ^v / j k select - enter run - tab cycle installed tools
  t cloud trial - f find faster or smarter - / search - c claims
  enter calibrate once - s skip forever

Recipes
  ^v / j k select - enter trial - w trial in a window
  s set up - n / r needs - d details - / search - c claims
  ? figures and sources - space toggle boosts in details

Setup and Ready
  enter / y approve - enter open tool - n / esc back
  d steps and logs - ctrl-c pause
  u undo from Ready - q later

Cloud sign-in
  enter browser / connect - p paste - esc back

Trial summary
  1 too slow - 2 fine - 3 great - s set up - t another

Needs - ^v / j k / tab row - <-> / h l change - enter apply
Search - enter search - esc back
Claims - ^v / j k select - enter / ? open - ? source
Errors - d raw details
Chat - enter send - esc finish
Everywhere - esc back - q quit - ctrl-c stop

esc back  q quit